===Numeral===
{{head|en|numeral}}

# {{cln|en|cardinal numbers}} A [[numerical]] [[value]] after [[two]] and before [[four]]. Represented in Arabic digits as [[3]]; this many dots (•••).
#* {{RQ:Grey Riders|8}}
#*: Venters began to count them—one—two—'''three'''—four—on up to sixteen.
