#* {{quote-av|en|||{{w|Batman: Arkham City}}||||Why should she care? One…two…<br>Do we shoot '''on three'''?<br>Yes '''on three'''. Like one, two, '''three''', shoot.|role=Joker thugs|writers={{w|Paul Dini}}; Paul Crocker; {{w|Sefton Hill}}|network={{w|Rocksteady Studios}}|publisher={{w|Warner Bros. Interactive Entertainment}}|date=Oct 18 2011}}
